    <h1>Donate &amp; Save Tax</h1>
    <p>Please send your information regarding your donation to us by email at <a href="mailto:{{ site.contact.email }}">{{ site.contact.email }}</a> to receive a Money Receipt and 80G Exemption Certificate.</p>
    <p>A Certificate under Section 10BE of the IT Act will be issued for donations of &#8377;1,000 and above, against PAN/AADHAR. The 80G certificate under section 10BE will be sent to you once received from the Income Tax Department, Government of India.</p>
    <p><strong>Please note:</strong> PAN details are mandatory for donations amounting to &#8377;10,000 or more in a financial year.</p>
  </div>
</section>

